<title>UK: Nationsbank Capital Trust sets $500 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Nationsbank Capital Trust sets $500 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Bear Stearns, Lehman Brothers and Nationsbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONSBANK CAPITAL TRUST III</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.JAN.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +55 BP    PAY DATE  S-03.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES   1.00</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    **</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED TO YIELD 67-70 BP</p>
<p>		S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
